      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788211149170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Users should be able to post an item for auction with a starting price and\nend date.\n2. Users should be able to bid on an item, where bids are accepted if they\nare higher than the current highest bid.\n3. Users should be able to view an auction, including the current highest bid.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to post an item for auction with a starting price and\nend date.\n2. Users should be able to bid on an item, where bids are accepted if they\nare higher than the current highest bid.\n3. Users should be able to view an auction, including the current highest bid.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 119
    },
